{"id":"steam-1065270","steam":1065270,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Quitting Simulator","summary":"Bring the rage room to the office with this randomized destruction sandbox. Break things and craft with the wreckage. Commit safety violations and sue to earn Star Bucks! Climb the ladder, unionize, or ditch office life forever. Your actions affect the evening news! How do you want to quit today?","about":"•  Are you craving an escape from corporate routine, but are bound by its essential income?\r\n•  Do you delight in breaking things, but the cost of replacing them is becoming a concern?\r\n•  Do you despise your boss, but the constraints of law restrain your violent daydreams?\r\n\n\r\n\r\nUnleash your pent-up rage in this chaotic sandbox of destruction; optimized for relaxation. \r\n\r\n \r\nSue your way to prosperity! Break safety regulations and file lawsuits to earn Star Bucks!\r\n\r\n  \r\nSpend your Star Bucks on destructive / delicious items to become the ultimate consumer!\r\n\r\n  \r\nTurn trash to treasure! Recycling is effortless when every item is crafted from microplastic!\r\n\r\n\r\nMake memorable memos: send profanity-laden resignation letters to despised supervisors.\r\n\r\n  \r\nRevitalize your surroundings – if it's not securely anchored, consider it open to relocation.\r\n\r\n  \r\nReplay all day. Explore randomized environments with a lineup of whimsical characters.\r\n\r\n\r\nMake a News Debut! Our corporate journalist delves into the aftermath of your decisions.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065270/library_600x900.jpg?t=1733337922","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065270/header.jpg?t=1733337922","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065270/library_hero.jpg?t=1733337922","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065270/header.jpg?t=1733337922","background":"https://sh